  "question": "What\u2019s the nearest fast food along the travel direction from Sloth Encounters, Hauppauge, NY to Lucy Pullen Ridgewood, Ridgewood, NY?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.210029 40.824517)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.908693 40.706793)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'fast_food'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.210029 40.824517)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.210029 40.824517)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
